{"id":"wb-6-840","name":"云梦山摩崖","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"雲夢山摩崖","text":"云梦山摩崖位于中华人民共和国河南省鹤壁市淇县云梦山，是由摩崖题记、碑形石刻等组成的遗存群。现存元、明、清时期题记和碑刻二百余处，内容涉及山水游览、寺观修建及地方宗教活动，水帘洞周围保存有元代王恽及明代窦文等人的题刻。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%B2%E5%A4%A2%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96","revisionId":95081610,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95081610","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bd1d1bf0c9ca8fd2f3f3d5d3.jpg","title":"将坛_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B0%86%E5%9D%9B_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/%E5%B0%86%E5%9D%9B_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"山海风","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"将坛","width":320,"height":240}}